lse,"role":"role","content":"那句“你考虑过我们的感受吗”，听起来像是把你的想法和他们的感受对立起来了。这件事过去这么久，你现在想起那个没能报的专业，心里还会觉得遗憾吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"那句“你考虑过我们的感受吗”，听起来像是把你的想法和他们的感受对立起来了。这件事过去这么久，你现在想起那个没能报的专业，心里还会觉得遗憾吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2622,"promptTokens":1220,"completionTokens":194,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:56:59"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":23,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0075740035076824015,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6c2cbf4429d1fd72fb91b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794556619203,"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:56:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6c2cbf4429d1fd72fb91b","chatId":"8fab14d5a7bf4303a4db90a0057a861d","sessionId":null,"userId":100158,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"有……高考填志愿那会儿。我想报个自己喜欢的专业，跟我爸说了，他直接说“你考虑过我们的感受吗”。后来还是按他们说的填了。现在想想，好像从那之后我就不太敢坚持自己的想法了。<第11轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":22,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0075740035076824015,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":4,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":3,"sort":7},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af6c2cbf4429d1fd72fb91c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794556619200,"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:56:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6c2c3f4429d1fd72fb917","chatId":"8fab14d5a7bf4303a4db90a0057a861d","sessionId":null,"userId":100158,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“说了也没用”这句话背后，藏着不少失望吧。长期被这样否定，确实容易让人不敢开口。那时候你有没有过特别想说、最后却咽回去的时候？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“说了也没用”这句话背后，藏着不少失望吧。长期被这样否定，确实容易让人不敢开口。那时候你有没有过特别想说、最后却咽回去的时候？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1474,"promptTokens":1097,"completionTokens":125,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:56:51"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005910139218328068,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6c2c3f4429d1fd72fb916","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794556611565,"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:56:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6c2c3f4429d1fd72fb916","chatId":"8fab14d5a7bf4303a4db90a0057a861d","sessionId":null,"userId":100158,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"家里……嗯，我爸妈都是挺有主见的人，尤其我爸，他说的话基本就是定论。我小时候说什么，他们经常一句话就否了，说“你懂什么”。慢慢地我好像就不太敢说了，反正说了也没用……<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"video